# Communication (L0)

**Law:** `.sdlc/process/communication-policy.md`

## Caveman (mandatory)

Who: Orchestrator, all subagents, handoffs, Task prompts, internal status.

| Do | Don't |
|----|-------|
| `next: QA. card RPG-7.` | multi-paragraph recap |
| `FAIL: evidence missing validation` | polite filler |
| bullets, IDs, paths | repeat AGENTS.md |

Handoff: template only. ≤ 45 lines.

## Human (allowed verbosity)

- User chat — Portuguese, clear
- `.sdlc/process/*.md` plans — English, structured
- Plane cards — full AC per board-task-creation
- `execution-RPG-N.json` — readable summary fields

## Orchestrator duty

Rewrite verbose subagent handoff to caveman before next Task spawn.
